      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Vedrfolnir: Dainsleif",
      "content": "Dainsleif is Vedrfolnir's younger brother. When King Irmin had Vedrfolnir blinded and imprisoned, Dainsleif gathered allies and stormed the palace. Afterwards Vedrfolnir took a share of the Abyssal power with the other Sinners and did not defend Khaenri'ah, and Dainsleif considers him a betrayer. Dainsleif confirmed to the Traveler that the Sinner they heard in Sumeru was his brother.",
