      "key": [
        "palace raid",
        "storm the palace",
        "Vinster King",
        "King Irmin"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Vedrfolnir: The Palace Raid",
      "content": "Vedrfolnir warned King Irmin that Khaenri'ah would fall if the king continued on his path. The king had his eyes gouged out and cast him into the dungeons. Dainsleif, Surtalogi, Rhinedottir, Hroptatyr and Rerir planned a night raid to free him. Rerir reached the cell and spoke with him about fate.",
