      "comment": "Vedrfolnir: Skirk and Surtalogi",
      "content": "Surtalogi says Vedrfolnir told him he was destined to find a disciple out in the universe and bring her to Teyvat, and that Vedrfolnir's prophecies are never wrong. The disciple is Skirk. Skirk's introduction quotes both men about her coming.",
